{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Эренди манды эрлердин,", "text": "Эренди манды эрлердин,", "en": "Of the heroes, [the epithet is uncertain],", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle sequence resembles манды but neither word division nor sense is secure.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Калы аралык жүрөгү,", "text": "Калы аралык жүрөгү,", "en": "His heart ranged broadly between them,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Калы аралык is a provisional reading of pale, joined handwriting; English is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Караса ачык көздүн,", "text": "Караса ачык көздүн,", "en": "When he looked, his eyes were clear,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Таштай тура сөздүн,", "text": "Таштай тура сөздүн,", "en": "Of the word that stood firm as stone,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "тура is the best visual reading; the genitive construction depends on adjacent lines.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Калбай муңу келсе да,", "text": "Калбай муңу келсе да,", "en": "Even if sorrow came without remainder,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "муңу is pale and may be another noun; translation is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Хан жарлыгынан каршы де,", "text": "Хан жарлыгынан каршы де,", "en": "Say nothing against the khan's decree,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The terminal particle resembles де; English supplies the elliptical negative sense provisionally.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Кандай чакан кылсын,", "text": "Кандай чакан кылсын,", "en": "How could he make it small?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "чакан is a best-effort reading of joined strokes and may be another verb or noun.", "bbox": null}
