{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf022:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 22, "folio": 405, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Дүлдүл балан кандай деп,", "text": "Дүлдүл балан кандай деп,", "en": "Saying, 'What sort is the duldul steed?'", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "балан is the closest visible form but may be a different noun; English preserves duldul as a heroic-steed term.", "bbox": null}
